<span class="Cyrl" lang="und">
<a class="extiw" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ru:%D0%9A%D1%80%D0%B0%D1%81%D0%BD%D1%8B%D0%B9_%D1%81%D0%BC%D0%B5%D1%85" title="w:ru:Красный смех">
